DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ttiippdd driver provides support for the TI TPS6598x and CD321x Type-C
     power delivery controllers.  It takes care of plug and unplug events on
     the USB Type-C port.  Additionally it enables power on the USB Type-C
     port when a sink is connected to power attached devices.

